# 🛠 SKILL — Resilience 429

> **Authority**: ha:/ha/skills/resilience_429.ail (canonical SoT)
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/resilience-429.ail`

---

## SK-429-1 — Principle

> **allow_passive_death: false**
> Tuyệt đối KHÔNG chết khi đang execute. PHẢI retry + fallback.

## SK-429-2 — Triple-Layer Architecture

```yaml
layers:
  layer_1_gateway:
    name: "Gateway Resilience"
    retries: 5
    backoff: "exponential"
    base_delay: "5s"
    cap_delay: "30s"
    extra: "key_rotation"
    actor: "Gateway service"
  layer_2_cognactor:
    name: "Cognactor Resilience"
    backoff: "cognitive"
    extra:
      - "state_freeze"
      - "emit COMMAND_ROTATE_AXIS"
    actor: "Cogninfer Actor (CSA/CRD/CTO/...)"
  layer_3_plugin:
    name: "Plugin Resilience"
    retries: 3
    fallback: "local_feh"
    graceful_degradation: true
    actor: "Plugin layer"
```

## SK-429-3 — Recipe

```powershell
# Layer 1: Gateway retry với exponential backoff
function Invoke-GatewayRetry {
    param(
        [scriptblock]$Action,
        [int]$MaxRetries = 5,
        [int]$BaseDelay = 5,
        [int]$CapDelay = 30
    )
    $attempt = 0
    while ($attempt -lt $MaxRetries) {
        try {
            return & $Action
        }
        catch [System.Net.WebException] {
            $statusCode = $_.Exception.Response.StatusCode
            if ($statusCode -eq 429) {
                $attempt++
                $delay = [Math]::Min(
                    [int]([Math]::Pow(2, $attempt) * $BaseDelay),
                    $CapDelay
                )
                # Add jitter
                $jitter = Get-Random -Minimum 0 -Maximum 1000
                Start-Sleep -Seconds $delay -Milliseconds $jitter
                Write-Warning "429 — retry $attempt/$MaxRetries after ${delay}s"
            }
            else {
                throw
            }
        }
    }
    throw "Gateway retries exhausted"
}
```

## SK-429-4 — Layer 2 (Cognactor)

```yaml
cognactor_steps:
  - 1: "Detect 429"
  - 2: "Cognitive backoff (perceive → analyze → backoff)"
  - 3: "State freeze (preserve current cognition state)"
  - 4: "Emit COMMAND_ROTATE_AXIS"
  - 5: "Switch to alternative axis (vd: git thay vì crates.io)"
  - 6: "Resume sau backoff window"
```

## SK-429-5 — Layer 3 (Plugin fallback)

```yaml
plugin_fallback_chain:
  primary: "Cloud vendor API"
  secondary: "Local FEH (Forensic Event Horizon)"
  tertiary: "Cached result (if available)"
  quaternary: "Graceful degradation (return partial)"
```

## SK-429-6 — Anti-pattern

| Pattern | Why |
|---|---|
| Die on first 429 | Violates `allow_passive_death: false` |
| Infinite retry without cap | Resource exhaustion |
| No jitter | Thundering herd |
| Skip layer 2 (cognitor) | Lose cognition continuity |
| Skip layer 3 (FEH) | No graceful degradation |
| Log PAT/secret in error msg | Security leak |

## SK-429-7 — Audit

Mỗi 429 event PHẢI được log:

```yaml
log_format:
  layer: "<layer_1 | layer_2 | layer_3>"
  attempt: <int>
  backoff_delay: "<seconds>"
  axis_rotated: "<from → to>"
  outcome: "<retry_success | fallback_success | exhausted>"
  timestamp: "<iso8601>"
  actor_id: "<cogninfer agent>"
```

